.\n\nChoice of clothing and art direction is up to you. \n\nHis reference: https://imgur.com/a/cxvXCCE\nHis clothing: https://imgur.com/a/Fmr3Q7A\n\nHope this is okay, thank you! I am always excited to see what you come up with!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ukimon_KM888/works/96", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/407eae56/uploads/outputs/54eee879-bc2c-49c8-ac64-fd2996a75d24?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=43a29829d334be0e3301f70201c10650", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/407eae56/uploads/outputs/54eee879-bc2c-49c8-ac64-fd2996a75d24?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=43a29829d334be0e3301f70201c10650, https://si.imgix.net/407eae56/uploads/outputs/54eee879-bc2c-49c8-ac64-fd2996a75d24?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1d2f1b1b509e25d292a7e16ee45d5078 2x, https://si.imgix.net/407eae56/uploads/outputs/54eee879-bc2c-49c8-ac64-fd2996a75d24?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=147bed6b62869ead28c0c649df6cff79 3x", "genre": "video", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私のキャラクターがおどけるところを描いてもらえませんか？人を笑わせるのが大好きなピエロです。シンプルな背景で構いませんし、必要であれば彼女の衣装ももう少しシンプルにしてください！動画も1920×1080にしてもらえますか？ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1ccYCVwtOiawSiL2k0tovZSb9qNmGTG6u/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ukimon_KM888/works/95", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/de5933fb/uploads/outputs/fb377d36-39d0-429d-8710-72c6b75ced40?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cbc570fadd494bf8069f639d9b050403", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/de5933fb/uploads/outputs/fb377d36-39d0-429d-8710-72c6b75ced40?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cbc570fadd494bf8069f639d9b050403, https://si.imgix.net/de5933fb/uploads/outputs/fb377d36-39d0-429d-8710-72c6b75ced40?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c3471f6173a84715625ac